      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\r\n Karlee Myers\r\nOllin / Pottery NPCs\n\r\nShengyu Xiang\r\nMummy
    Enemy / Lizard\n\r\nAdam Ridsdale\r\nSun and Moon Staff\n\r\nRobert Fletcher\r\nGolem\n\r\nMicheal
    O\u2019Connor\r\nFireTrap / BallTrackSet\n\r\nGraeme Miller\r\nGoddess of the
    Moon / MegaDoor / Power Swap Node\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKarlee Myers\r\n\nGraeme Miller\r\n\nRobert
    Fletcher\r\n\nMicheal O\u2019Connor\r\n\nShengyu Xiang\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\nFire \u2013
    Robert Fletcher\r\nSun and Moon Laser - Robert Fletcher\r\nSun/Moon/Eclipse \u2013
    Graeme Miller\r\nFireflies/Sparkles \u2013 Robert Fletcher\r\nPower Swap \u2013
    Karlee Myers\r\nPointer Target \u2013 Karlee Myers\r\nDust Circle \u2013 Karlee
    Myers\r\nSkybox \u2013 Karlee Myers \r\nWater - Micheal O\u2019Connor\r\nLava
    - Robert Fletcher\nCheckpoint energy - Adam Ridsdale\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\nGraeme Miller\r\nAdam
    Ridsdale\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\nTom Sutherland\r\n"
